{"title":"Glimmerfox","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 41 Moonbeast that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 3 times (0.7% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/moonhart-antler\">Moonhart Antler</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=41\">Lv 41 <span>348</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=42\">Lv 42 <span>341</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=43\">Lv 43 <span>11</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=41\" title=\"Pick level 41\"><td><b>41</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>203</td><td>27.1</td><td>2,050</td><td class=\"muted\">609 · 37.9 · 6,150</td><td>348</td><td>in the wilds around 1669, 1652</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=42\" title=\"Pick level 42\"><td><b>42</b></td><td>212</td><td>27.6</td><td>2,100</td><td class=\"muted\">636 · 38.6 · 6,300</td><td>341</td><td>in the wilds around 1666, 1651</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=43\" title=\"Pick level 43\"><td><b>43</b></td><td>222</td><td>28.2</td><td>2,150</td><td class=\"muted\">666 · 39.5 · 6,450</td><td>11</td><td>in the wilds around 1694, 1561</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 16 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silver-hide\" title=\"Silver Hide - in 81% of 16 looted corpses, 12 recorded drops, 17 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/33e265dd0c1eb3e33136.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">81% · 13/16</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"glimmerfox-pelt\" title=\"Glimmerfox Pelt - in 69% of 16 looted corpses, 10 recorded drops, 12 total, 1–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/03a19913fc54d1b9159e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Glimmerfox Pelt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">69% · 11/16</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link quest\" data-item=\"pilfered-seed-pouch\" title=\"Pilfered Seed Pouch - in 38% of 16 looted corpses, 6 recorded drops, 6 total, 1 per drop - Quest item: Too Tidy for a Fox\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c8fc82cf3937e075611f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"quest-tag\" title=\"Quest item\">Q</span><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Pilfered Seed Pouch</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">38% · 6/16</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dr